  Style: 1
  Nodes:
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_DISTRESS_01
    DefaultText: "그리고...\n소식이 끊겼다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_DISTRESS_02
    DefaultText: "오직, 짧은 구조 신호\n하나만을 남긴 채."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_DISTRESS_03
    DefaultText: "“…긴급 구조를\n요청한다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_DISTRESS_04
    DefaultText: "누군가 이 신호를\n듣는다면—”"
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
